  "text": "proprium.beatae-mariae-virginis-a-rosario-collecta",
  "about": "The collecta of the formulary “Blessed Virgin Mary of the Rosary” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "O God, Whose only-begotten Son, by His life, death and resurrection, has merited for us the grace of eternal salvation, grant, we beseech You, that, meditating on those mysteries in the most holy Rosary of the Blessed Virgin Mary, we may imitate what they contain and obtain what they promise. Through the same our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen." }
  },
